# scripts/opcount: tally N generated events read one at a time from
# standard input (json.Elements); the cost of one event is the slope
# between the two sizes. The control is the hand Go program that reads the
# same array with encoding/json's Decoder (Token, More, Decode). The
# json.Decode reference is the same workload with `args whole`, for the
# program and the control (stdlib.md json 8).
unit event
sizes 20000 220000
input self gen {n}
args stream
control examples/events/testdata/control
